spice
* Operational Amplifier Circuit
* Nodes: 1: vin, 2: Inverting Input, 3: Non-Inverting Input, 4: -Vcc (Ground), 5: Node connected to RL, 6: Output, 7: +Vcc

* Voltage Sources
VCC 7 0 DC 15
Vin 1 0 AC 2m

* Resistors
R1 2 3 3.3k
R2 2 4 82k
R3 5 0 91k
RL 6 5 10k

* Capacitors
C1 1 2 4.7u
C2 6 5 10u
C3 4 0 4.7u

* Op-Amp
* (Node 2: Inverting Input, Node 3: Non-Inverting Input, Node 6: Output, Node 7: +Vcc, Node 4: -Vcc)
XU1 2 3 6 7 4 opamp741

* Model Definition for the 741 Op-Amp
.model opamp741 opamp

